{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Creator is a profession that uses items to fight. By killing monsters and dropping items, collecting items, creating items, building your own territory, and defending against monster sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the trap-ejection board can set the ejection direction and distance through two boards to relay ejection to kill monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/2222.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the mechanism-flywheel can launch a flywheel back and forth 8 meters in front of itself, and will damage and bleed the monsters that collide during the flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u673a\u5173-\u98de\u8f6e.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the mechanism-ejection ball can perform up to 5 relay ejection damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u673a\u5173-\u5f39\u5c04\u5854.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the power grid tower can form a lightning array with other power grid towers to use thunder balls to attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u7535\u7f51\u5854.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the flying sword tower can shuttle like a swimming fish and kill the enemy quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"kill monster 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/09e5121223e85040331cbee8119b1a9c7d44c7f4.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 99","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/e265849bba5bc315da4c75129add2f2a5198b103.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/ec773b1fdd9e01dd565a427b10a1e9d05528547c.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 9999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/4a2c39f0e9b5e054432a64bb397b29881720f142.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 99999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/ecca0918b384cf83df211569e02a3eff0fbfad37.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183400?t=1744248778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/b83563e2d8c952b186570e21ca99c2d55ce4f863/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744248778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/aba67ee4a24616795dcdac98839a841d2da1a6b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744248778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/aba67ee4a24616795dcdac98839a841d2da1a6b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744248778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Creator is a profession that uses items to fight. By killing monsters and dropping items, collecting items, creating items, building your own territory, and defending against monster sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the trap-ejection board can set the ejection direction and distance through two boards to relay ejection to kill monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/2222.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the mechanism-flywheel can launch a flywheel back and forth 8 meters in front of itself, and will damage and bleed the monsters that collide during the flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u673a\u5173-\u98de\u8f6e.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the mechanism-ejection ball can perform up to 5 relay ejection damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u673a\u5173-\u5f39\u5c04\u5854.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the power grid tower can form a lightning array with other power grid towers to use thunder balls to attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/\u7535\u7f51\u5854.gif?t=1744248778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, the flying sword tower can shuttle like a swimming fish and kill the enemy quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["icon123"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/aa655783d910da2411cc6d454230424122cfb5bf/header.jpg?t=1744248778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"hi